{"id":"n65647-1-7","stage":5,"title":"신형 · 新型","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n65647-1-7-1","ko":"얼마 전 우리나라에서 최첨단의 신형 무기를 개발했다면서? 점점 발전하는구나.","zh":"听说不久前咱们国家研发出了最先进的新型武器？发展得真快啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"얼마","meaning":"稍微，多少","explanation":"얼마：稍微，多少","readings":[{"term":"얼마","audio":"/audio/8e0a4529e0c9d4ed9058.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29750","senseId":"3","lemma":"얼마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼마","audio":"/audio/8e0a4529e0c9d4ed9058.mp3"}},{"text":"전","meaning":"以前","explanation":"전：以前","readings":[{"term":"전","audio":"/audio/d9f427c3257e81e05a24.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17301","senseId":"1","lemma":"전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"전","audio":"/audio/d9f427c3257e81e05a24.mp3"}},{"text":"우리나라에서","meaning":"我们国家，我国","explanation":"우리나라：我们国家，我国；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"우리나라","audio":"/audio/c32807440d40f0d826c4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70403","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리나라","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리나라에서","audio":"/audio/216ec31b5fa67189692e.mp3"}},{"text":"최첨단의","meaning":"最尖端，最顶尖","explanation":"최첨단：最尖端，最顶尖；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"최첨단","audio":"/audio/ef39304bd4273e1667d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79487","senseId":"1","lemma":"최첨단","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"최첨단의","audio":"/audio/bf13f39bd2c1ed529c20.mp3"}},{"text":"신형","meaning":"新型","explanation":"신형：新型","readings":[{"term":"신형","audio":"/audio/c0b8103da23ddcb1e8fa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65647","senseId":"1","lemma":"신형","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"신형","audio":"/audio/c0b8103da23ddcb1e8fa.mp3"}},{"text":"무기를","meaning":"武器，军火","explanation":"무기：武器，军火；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"무기","audio":"/audio/0f0f86540c4fcf3d7b12.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15319","senseId":"1","lemma":"무기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무기를","audio":"/audio/8059001fcad44154fdda.mp3"}},{"text":"개발했다면서?","meaning":"开发，研发","explanation":"개발하다：开发，研发；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다면서：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"개발하다","audio":"/audio/efdf0e73eeaac482e7e3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62257","senseId":"4","lemma":"개발하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"개발했다면서","audio":"/audio/4d6dac5f3e289464b3f9.mp3"}},{"text":"점점","meaning":"越来越","explanation":"점점：越来越","readings":[{"term":"점점","audio":"/audio/2de57161655ba687e8ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70871","senseId":"1","lemma":"점점","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"점점","audio":"/audio/2de57161655ba687e8ee.mp3"}},{"text":"발전하는구나.","meaning":"发展","explanation":"발전하다：发展；는구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"발전하다","audio":"/audio/605200f336ddc53d7cb5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56083","senseId":"1","lemma":"발전하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"발전하는구나","audio":"/audio/cdb0cd126090ddea7aed.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8e0a4529e0c9d4ed","term":"얼마","zh":"稍微，多少","audio":"/audio/8e0a4529e0c9d4ed9058.mp3","entryId":"29750","definition":"无需说明的少的数量、价值、程度。","pronunciation":["얼마"]},{"id":"d9f427c3257e81e0","term":"전","zh":"以前","audio":"/audio/d9f427c3257e81e05a24.mp3","entryId":"17301","definition":"过去的某时。","pronunciation":["전"]},{"id":"c32807440d40f0d8","term":"우리나라","zh":"我们国家，我国","audio":"/audio/c32807440d40f0d826c4.mp3","entryId":"70403","definition":"韩国人用于指称自己的国家。","pronunciation":["우리나라"]},{"id":"ef39304bd4273e16","term":"최첨단","zh":"最尖端，最顶尖","audio":"/audio/ef39304bd4273e1667d1.mp3","entryId":"79487","definition":"时代、流行、技术等处于前沿。","pronunciation":["최ː첨단","췌ː첨단"]},{"id":"c0b8103da23ddcb1","term":"신형","zh":"新型","audio":"/audio/c0b8103da23ddcb1e8fa.mp3","entryId":"65647","definition":"与以前不同的新种类或模样。","pronunciation":["신형"]},{"id":"0f0f86540c4fcf3d","term":"무기","zh":"武器，军火","audio":"/audio/0f0f86540c4fcf3d7b12.mp3","entryId":"15319","definition":"在打仗时，为了杀伤敌人而使用的工具。","pronunciation":["무ː기"]},{"id":"efdf0e73eeaac482","term":"개발하다","zh":"开发，研发","audio":"/audio/efdf0e73eeaac482e7e3.mp3","entryId":"62257","definition":"做出新的东西或提出新的想法。","pronunciation":["개발하다"]},{"id":"2de57161655ba687","term":"점점","zh":"越来越","audio":"/audio/2de57161655ba687e8ee.mp3","entryId":"70871","definition":"程度随着时间的推移而逐渐地。","pronunciation":["점ː점"]},{"id":"605200f336ddc53d","term":"발전하다","zh":"发展","audio":"/audio/605200f336ddc53d7cb5.mp3","entryId":"56083","definition":"提升到更好的状态或更高的阶段。","pronunciation":["발쩐하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/91207b9a7b5633cd1958.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n65647-1-7-2","ko":"응, 그러네. 우리도 언젠가는 무기를 수입하지 않고 모든 무기를 스스로 생산할 수 있었으면 좋겠어.","zh":"嗯，确实如此。我们也希望有朝一日能不用进口武器，全部靠自己生产出来。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"그러네.","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그러네","audio":"/audio/55f94fce65c9e23ec551.mp3"}},{"text":"우리도","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리도","audio":"/audio/e38d802f2fea2ee2a659.mp3"}},{"text":"언젠가는","meaning":"有一天","explanation":"언젠가：有一天；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"언젠가","audio":"/audio/5c458893d87519e460ad.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67286","senseId":"1","lemma":"언젠가","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"언젠가는","audio":"/audio/4a56ea59b6aa1511d177.mp3"}},{"text":"무기를","meaning":"武器，军火","explanation":"무기：武器，军火；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"무기","audio":"/audio/0f0f86540c4fcf3d7b12.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15319","senseId":"1","lemma":"무기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무기를","audio":"/audio/8059001fcad44154fdda.mp3"}},{"text":"수입하지","meaning":"进口","explanation":"수입하다：进口；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"수입하다","audio":"/audio/80c4dc87bc8d078d82e8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74198","senseId":"1","lemma":"수입하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수입하지","audio":"/audio/887b42b0b8b602ee3835.mp3"}},{"text":"않고","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17186","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"않고","audio":"/audio/0a35d31b8ad5abd7d1f4.mp3"}},{"text":"모든","meaning":"全，所有","explanation":"모든：全，所有","readings":[{"term":"모든","audio":"/audio/f069e2cf4e3407407846.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70813","senseId":"1","lemma":"모든","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모든","audio":"/audio/f069e2cf4e3407407846.mp3"}},{"text":"무기를","meaning":"武器，军火","explanation":"무기：武器，军火；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"무기","audio":"/audio/0f0f86540c4fcf3d7b12.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15319","senseId":"1","lemma":"무기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무기를","audio":"/audio/8059001fcad44154fdda.mp3"}},{"text":"스스로","meaning":"自己，亲自","explanation":"스스로：自己，亲自","readings":[{"term":"스스로","audio":"/audio/53445f4fae94053b5caa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62476","senseId":"1","lemma":"스스로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"스스로","audio":"/audio/53445f4fae94053b5caa.mp3"}},{"text":"생산할","meaning":"生产","explanation":"생산하다：生产；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"생산하다","audio":"/audio/bd752bbc6d1ef4b93a0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16240","senseId":"1","lemma":"생산하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생산할","audio":"/audio/b12c2a05a4f18ce7b00d.mp3"}},{"text":"수","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}},{"text":"있었으면","meaning":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","explanation":"있다：能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；으면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"5","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있었으면","audio":"/audio/2a775546dba0ef46720f.mp3"}},{"text":"좋겠어.","meaning":"那样就好了","explanation":"좋다：那样就好了；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"18","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋겠어","audio":"/audio/3b128c5b8414727d9531.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"5c458893d87519e4","term":"언젠가","zh":"有一天","audio":"/audio/5c458893d87519e460ad.mp3","entryId":"67286","definition":"在未来的某时。","pronunciation":["언ː젠가"]},{"id":"0f0f86540c4fcf3d","term":"무기","zh":"武器，军火","audio":"/audio/0f0f86540c4fcf3d7b12.mp3","entryId":"15319","definition":"在打仗时，为了杀伤敌人而使用的工具。","pronunciation":["무ː기"]},{"id":"80c4dc87bc8d078d","term":"수입하다","zh":"进口","audio":"/audio/80c4dc87bc8d078d82e8.mp3","entryId":"74198","definition":"将外国的商品或技术等买进国内。","pronunciation":["수이파다"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"17186","definition":"不做某种行动。","pronunciation":["안타"]},{"id":"f069e2cf4e340740","term":"모든","zh":"全，所有","audio":"/audio/f069e2cf4e3407407846.mp3","entryId":"70813","definition":"一个不漏或一个不剩，全部的。","pronunciation":["모ː든"]},{"id":"53445f4fae94053b","term":"스스로","zh":"自己，亲自","audio":"/audio/53445f4fae94053b5caa.mp3","entryId":"62476","definition":"不接受别人的帮助，依靠自己的力量。","pronunciation":["스스로"]},{"id":"bd752bbc6d1ef4b9","term":"생산하다","zh":"生产","audio":"/audio/bd752bbc6d1ef4b93a0e.mp3","entryId":"16240","definition":"制造人们生活中所需的东西。","pronunciation":["생산하다"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"那样就好了","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"否定前面的同时进行指责。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/ec7599f40e7d12dd89ed.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":6.202,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=65647","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":177,"sequenceScore":6.0287,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["嗯，确实如此。我们也希望有朝一日能不用进口武器，全部靠自己生产出来。","听说不久前咱们国家研发出了最先进的新型武器？发展得真快啊。","据国防部发布的消息，有邻国的人频繁偷偷越过边境进入我国。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["听说不久前咱们国家研发出了最先进的新型武器？发展得真快啊。","据国防部发布的消息，有邻国的人频繁偷偷越过边境进入我国。","嗯，确实如此。我们也希望有朝一日能不用进口武器，全部靠自己生产出来。"],"answer":2}]}
